msgstr "Tez-tez so'raladigan savollar"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "How do I add a currency converter to my page?"
msgstr "Sahifamga valyuta konvertorini qanday qo'shaman?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Use the shortcode [currencywiki_converter] or add the Currency Kit block in the Gutenberg editor."
msgstr "[currencywiki_converter] qisqa kodidan foydalaning yoki Gutenberg tahrirlovchisida Valyuta to'plami blokini qo'shing."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Can I customize the widget colors?"
msgstr "Vidjet ranglarini sozlashim mumkinmi?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Yes! Go to Currency Kit → Dashboard and select your preferred accent color from the color palette."
msgstr "Ha! Valyuta to'plami → Boshqaruv paneliga o'ting va rang palitrasidan afzal rangingizni tanlang."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "How often are exchange rates updated?"
msgstr "Valyuta kurslari qanchalik tez-tez yangilanadi?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Exchange rates are updated in real-time from Currency.Wiki API."
msgstr "Valyuta kurslari Currency.Wiki API dan real vaqtda yangilanadi."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Need More Help?"
msgstr "Qo'shimcha yordam kerakmi?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Contact our support team or visit our documentation for more information."
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlash jamoamiz bilan bog'laning yoki qo'shimcha ma'lumot uchun hujjatlarimizni ko'ring."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Get Support"
msgstr "Yordam oling"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Display currency converter on your sidebar. (Legacy V2 widget - consider using the Gutenberg block instead)"
msgstr "Valyuta konvertorini yon panelingizda ko'rsating. (Merosi V2 vidjeti - o'rniga Gutenberg blokidan foydalanishni ko'rib chiqing)"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Currency Converter Widget (Legacy)"
msgstr "Valyuta konvertori vidjeti (Merosi)"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Legacy Widget"
msgstr "Merosi vidjeti"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "This is a legacy V2 widget. For more features and better customization, use the new Currency Converter block in the Gutenberg editor."
msgstr "Bu merosi V2 vidjeti. Ko'proq funksiyalar va yaxshiroq sozlash uchun Gutenberg tahrirlovchisida yangi Valyuta konvertori blokidan foydalaning."

